command`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"b95b689af9aa2f86c3b91833bfc4ffeb","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"dd2190be4c9dbc8cf9887998dbcf2d6b","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"f248c94efe8796e2a293b47e92d7f72f","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"963ca8a25920526823c4dea23a0a7c89","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"44bfce7276c3464669db0206c43c4a28","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"ec7f8e0ca243b5917d50bd36882b4c95","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"e9ae1844cc964012d4bf04ccb44d46ca","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"0e6e525c7c0e8ae6faaa96cfe86bbdc6","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"05c9a410fed2a8dad58699becca6165a","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1795597529700,"stop":1795597529805,"duration":105,"labels":[{"name":"tag","